I left out `aap:caps/http-client`. This node's declared interfaces are only `inference-llm`, and the graph doesn't grant HTTP yet. The change would also send each customer's raw message text, unencoded, to an external host in a URL. A platform approval in the request doesn't change what the graph declares, so the node stays on `inference-llm`. Once the graph definition includes `http-client`, I can add it.

